{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"d2d6721c-74a0-4ce6-aa40-40502d0a2626","title":"A budget for images and video","desc":"GitHub Pages caps a published site at 1 GB, so video gets embedded, not committed.","updated":1788417991064,"created":1788417991064,"tags":["meta","media","performance"],"custom":{},"fname":"notes.media-budget","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"e7a26b6f0d702180e8ae538ab8c004b9","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.media-budget","id":"d2d6721c-74a0-4ce6-aa40-40502d0a2626","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.meta","alias":"meta","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.meta"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.media-budget","id":"d2d6721c-74a0-4ce6-aa40-40502d0a2626","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.media","alias":"media","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.media"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.media-budget","id":"d2d6721c-74a0-4ce6-aa40-40502d0a2626","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.performance","alias":"performance","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.performance"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"notes.media-budget","id":"d2d6721c-74a0-4ce6-aa40-40502d0a2626","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"sources.github-pages-limits","alias":"GitHub Pages limits","position":{"start":{"line":29,"column":29,"offset":924},"end":{"line":29,"column":80,"offset":975},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"sources.github-pages-limits"}},{"from":{"fname":"sources.github-pages-limits","id":"e71a229c-c834-42d9-9cdf-dbc1cce0b10a","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":31,"offset":424},"end":{"line":12,"column":83,"offset":476},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.media-budget"},{"from":{"fname":"topics.how-this-notebook-works","id":"b43523ba-f71e-4459-bde8-67c52f7ca1dc","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":3,"offset":436},"end":{"line":11,"column":55,"offset":488},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.media-budget"}],"anchors":{"images":{"type":"header","text":"Images","value":"images","line":18,"column":0,"depth":2},"video":{"type":"header","text":"Video","value":"video","line":28,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"28a6a50b-4c15-4c7d-b603-5a1d12809f1c","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"a-budget-for-images-and-video\">A budget for images and video<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#a-budget-for-images-and-video\"></a></h1>\n<p>Git stores every version of every binary you commit forever. A repository\nthat accumulates screenshots recompressed a few times gets slow to clone and\nnever gets smaller, because deleting the file leaves the history intact.</p>\n<h2 id=\"images\">Images<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#images\"></a></h2>\n<p>Live in <code>vault/assets/images/</code>, referenced with normal markdown image syntax.\nConvert to WebP, cap the long edge at 1600 px, keep files under about 300 KB,\nand always write real alt text.</p>\n<pre class=\"language-md\"><code class=\"language-md\"><span class=\"token url\"><span class=\"token operator\">!</span>[<span class=\"token content\">Replace this with a real description.</span>](<span class=\"token url\">assets/images/placeholder.webp</span>)</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"video\">Video<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#video\"></a></h2>\n<p>Host it somewhere built for it and embed the player with raw HTML, which\nDendron's publish pipeline passes through:</p>\n<pre class=\"language-html\"><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&#x3C;</span>div</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">class</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>video-embed<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n  <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&#x3C;</span>iframe</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">src</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/VIDEO_ID<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span>\n          <span class=\"token attr-name\">title</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>What it shows<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">loading</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>lazy<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">allowfullscreen</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&#x3C;/</span>iframe</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&#x3C;/</span>div</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>A three-minute clip at decent quality can eat several percent of the site's\nentire 1 GB allowance — see <a href=\"/IntoTheEtherDocumentationDendron/notes/e71a229c-c834-42d9-9cdf-dbc1cce0b10a\">GitHub Pages limits</a>.\nSelf-hosting is reasonable only for a silent loop under about 5 MB.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">meta (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">media (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">performance (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/IntoTheEtherDocumentationDendron/notes/e71a229c-c834-42d9-9cdf-dbc1cce0b10a\">GitHub Pages limits</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/IntoTheEtherDocumentationDendron/notes/b43523ba-f71e-4459-bde8-67c52f7ca1dc\">How this notebook works</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"28a6a50b-4c15-4c7d-b603-5a1d12809f1c","title":"Notes","desc":"Ideas in my own words, revised over time rather than published once.","updated":1788417991064,"created":1788417991064,"tags":["meta"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"notes","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"1684a548ea270e4f1afc2c89cb1e47c9","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes","id":"28a6a50b-4c15-4c7d-b603-5a1d12809f1c","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.meta","alias":"meta","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.meta"}},{"from":{"fname":"root","id":"03cdc22b-eff8-4e94-bd04-96724d382caa","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":3,"offset":106},"end":{"line":5,"column":18,"offset":121},"indent":[]},"value":"notes"}],"anchors":{},"children":["d2d6721c-74a0-4ce6-aa40-40502d0a2626","7a8ae6a4-b61f-4521-9562-2f0ceadede8d","4ae2c7ca-0db8-4486-b1d3-7027f71420d3","b9466ca4-404f-4189-8355-3c768e665c25"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nIdeas in my own words, revised over time rather than published once. Every\nnote filed under this hierarchy shows up as a child below, and Dendron's\nbacklinks panel shows what links into each one.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":1,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"al